  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>어제<br>영재학급 수업을 했습니다<br><br>주제는 유체 였어요<br><br>매년 다루는데<br>작년은 층류를 주 주제로 다루었다면<br>이번에는 비행체를 주 주제로 다루었어어요<br><br><br>물체가 하늘에 뜨게 하는 여러방법들을 알아보고,<br>그 중 베르누이원리도 이해하며, 풍선과 헤어드라이기를 가지고 풍선을 옆으로 옮겨보고<br>그 원리를 직접 친구들 앞에서 설명해보고<br>마지막으로는 종이비행기를 오래 날게 하기 시합을 했습니다<br>에어로켓 미션수행하는 방법은 덤으로...<br><br>제가 만든 델타형 종이비행기가 가장 오래 날더군요<br>바람이 부니 오히려 비행기가 상승하더군요<br>과장해서 15초는 날았던...<br><br>그래서 저 빼고 다시 시합을 했습니다</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/12c4baa6310a89e1f133da6b2f46220b0adba1b5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/12c4baa6310a89e1f133da6b2f46220b0adba1b5\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"405\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/583b82afb60dc1ca7b9e6b3894cc9426f82f7ddf\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/583b82afb60dc1ca7b9e6b3894cc9426f82f7ddf\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"405\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/26d0360aababecbb407d87a6e5e79b5ae02c331f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/26d0360aababecbb407d87a6e5e79b5ae02c331f\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"405\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/615d60d6c4ba57d70b3b4ba83dde127d4a0303a5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/615d60d6c4ba57d70b3b4ba83dde127d4a0303a5\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"405\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br><br><br>저희학교 나무에는 <br>종이비행기가 점점 열리고 있어요<br><br>갑자기 드라마 &#39;창공&#39; 주제곡이 생각나네요<br>&quot;이 세상에서 너를 만났다&quot;<br>나를 만나 기억되길....<br>이 친구들이<br>내년 3학년이 되면<br>에어로켓 교내 대회에서 잘 만들길 바라며....<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>드라마 &#39;창공&#39;이 아니라 드라마 &#39;도전&#39;의 가사네요<br><a href=\"https://youtu.be/4_aWb30xMSc\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/4_aWb30xMSc</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4_aWb30xMSc\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"640\" data-video-height=\"480\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/biXDoi/hyOxowGg8e/a13kwvxfTQxFeW96cjw6MK/img.jpg?width=640&amp;height=480&amp;face=230_161_365_228\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"640\" data-video-origin-height=\"480\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4_aWb30xMSc\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>-------------------------------------------------------------------<br>다음날 쉬는시간에 잠시, 다시 만들어 날려봤어요<br>바람이 많지 않았는데.....</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv5lskl609p5wxr619j2pz4w5@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"1920\" data-video-height=\"864\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rv5lskl609p5wxr619j2pz4w5/thumbs/2.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33210426884&amp;signature=OGaqQVwkLSwq5vXIHIQdXOn3ImU%3D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"1920\" data-video-origin-height=\"864\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv5lskl609p5wxr619j2pz4w5?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2NWxza2w2MDlwNXd4cjYxOWoycHo0dzUiLCJ0aWQiOiI0MWE1MjE3Ni0yMGJkLTRkYTAtODNiOC04MTdlODQzZmU0YjMiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxOTA0NDh9.YDu-9HQAhR_YU8urmxIFUqgB0Q_PkV3S-ZUqwA5ZKrXiuTNOudDDCszpV9KKv-RmBatUP4YW2XZczWFgGFAt9w&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"1920\" height=\"864\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">10초 정도 나는 영상</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">-시작전 영상, 던지는 자세가 멋지네요 ㅋㅋ</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
